        <briefdescription>
<para>Initialize the WiFi manager and start connection. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function initializes:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>NVS storage</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>network interface</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>WiFi driver</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>event handlers</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>The WiFi connection process is started immediately.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>config</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Pointer to configuration structure.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>ESP_OK on success</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ESP_ERR_INVALID_ARG if config is invalid</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Other ESP-IDF error codes on failure </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
