        <type>esp_err_t</type>
        <definition>esp_err_t wifi_manager_wait_connected</definition>
        <argsstring>(void)</argsstring>
        <name>wifi_manager_wait_connected</name>
        <param>
          <type>void</type>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Block until WiFi connection is established. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function waits until the ESP32 receives an IP address from the access point.</para>
<para>Useful to ensure the network is ready before starting services such as:</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>MQTT clients</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>TCP servers</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>UDP streaming</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>HTTP requests</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>ESP_OK if connection successful</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ESP_FAIL if connection failed </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
